msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do terraço do restaurante, dava para ouvir o grito das gaivotas."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1E8DEAC5_3FD8_4F83_89B7_1E384764178A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0287150f58a9734b40231049635736587528bd091e2fd3e855fffa57a411613
