#: scenario2:scenario2_3A8CFF89_3E95_459A_8AC8_A88B0B6A63BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 568bebe12b230e6d15f16c1e8eb7c611bba93b9e09bf929e77f3d2f289a35710
