msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m a huge fan of this country’s food."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu sou um grande fã da comida deste país."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DD2EEC4_9504_480C_A032_69636D6B850E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bd4e43e2c72da0d8e2089ebc973a58ec32b90bb3eb7d58d78baa0e2433c27cd
#. default-sha256: 2e9809c7d841fc6b2a23d7dce0a908632cd5c60e1871d94a9c4b248e673b4e04
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1DD2EEC4_9504_480C_A032_69636D6B850E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One taste and you never forget it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’d like to bring the entire cuisine back with "
"me if I could."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Basta provar uma vez para nunca esquecer.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu gostaria de trazer toda a culinária de "
"volta comigo, se pudesse."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CB4A3C35_AE7C_42D8_97AB_998B740FD2DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a62ff228ca37d38560e616616eada3ba828ccc420cd33720264c471c300974ae
#. default-sha256: b44719487ef8be0a2cc3931c91376d2eb710facbea5b7c5dee2e83fc53ef8e9e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CB4A3C35_AE7C_42D8_97AB_998B740FD2DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is the first time we’ve seen you in how long,⟪k:1⟫and you’re talking about ⟪k:2⟫"
"food⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The first thing you asked when you arrived was,⟪k:6⟫“Is the restaurant by the "
"seaside still open?” for goodness’ sake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Esta é a primeira vez que vemos você em Deus sabe quanto tempo,⟪k:1⟫e você está falando "
"sobre ⟪k:2⟫comida⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A primeira coisa que você perguntou quando chegou foi:⟪k:6⟫“O "
"restaurante à beira-mar ainda está aberto?” pelo amor de Deus."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5D22588D_23FA_4C4A_BEEA_9AA2867028FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1d79f333fefd53c85c9ef8cec62e0d870d2fb2a2add1c3eb4576680c36370f4
